Description: Kowabunga Koala Web Client
 Kowabunga stands for 'Kvm Orchestrator With A BUNch of Goods Added'.
 .
 Koala is the official web client for Kowabunga: a static single-page
 application to be served by any web server, with /api proxied to the
 Kowabunga Kahuna engine.
